      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would love to just specify a maximum character height for each seat. For example, I would only like characters under 1m to be able to sit in particular seats.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-04-15T21:14:12.403Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With the ability to put seats on avatars its amazing but very anoying sometimes. Especially when an avatar bigger then you sits on your head or wherever the seat is. So what if you can make a size limit for the chair's. You can base it off the view point hight when making an avatar. That way someone that has a hight of 1.8 cant sit on a chair that's on an avatar with the hight of 0.8. Just an idea i thought would make chair's on avatars better.",
